}.

/// The animation plays _backwards_ each cycle. In other words, each time the animation cycles, the
/// animation will reset to the end state and start over again. Animation steps are performed
/// backwards, and easing functions are also reversed. For example, an `ease-in` easing function
/// becomes `ease-out`.

pub type Reverse =
    Atom["reverse"].
